  "dependencies": [
    "The private PE image executes original Unit classification with flat base passability and movement costs supplied; this is not original full-map pathfinding.",
    "Drive is constructed and linked with original constructor/COM link and receives original MoveTo plus supplied eastward next-path direction.",
    "Drive CanEnterCell return codes 0/6/7 are controlled for isolated branch checks; original Unit classification establishes code 6 separately.",
    "Cell Mark and order/animation callbacks are captured. RNG is one controlled roll. Ordinary human IQ is zero, computer IQ five.",
    "The admitted path stops after its original warning and before track execution. Blocked branches execute their original return.",
    "Earlier sentinel, human-IQ, terrain-cost and unrelated moving-block UI fixture failures remain preserved."
  ],
  "observations": [
    "Stationary allied infantry produce entry class 6. Drive class 6 invokes CellScatterContent with both ignore flags true, for crushers and non-crushers.",
    "Forced blockage scatter bypasses the default player/IQ gate and may undeploy human GI. Existing ordinary movement still declines scatter.",
    "Hard code 7 does not scatter. Clear code 0 retains the Scene50 ordinary crusher warning policy."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No complete original frame scheduling, pathfinder, track execution, forced-scatter repetition cadence or human playtesting claim.",
    "This product scope concerns allied-only physical infantry blockers, not mixed hostile/vehicle occupancy or all locomotors."
  ]
}
